Z||000003||terryk||08-28-2001||11:36 AM||||Right, the gauges are worth more than the car. Spend the money on something else.<P>Maybe it would be better said that even on a high-priced trailer queen, the gauges would be a substantial portion of the value. I think it's a bad return on investment in any sense.<P>They are cool though!<p>[This message has been edited by terryk (edited 08-28-2001).]||||reg||1
